DTSTART:20261128T150000Z
DTEND:20261128T170000Z
SUMMARY:Drummer Boy
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:As America’s fight for independence begins\, a young drummer 
 boy\, an enslaved woman\, and a divided family each search for freedom in 
 a world built to deny it. With music carrying hope through battle and loss
 \, Drummer Boy turns the Revolution into a deeply human story of faith\, f
 orgiveness\, and the belief that no person is born to live in chains or be
  forgotten.\nhttps://www.gardencinemas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: ht
 tps://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0bc3a0ebcfc1b3513c9833ed89d2ebdba6c1bb13@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261128T153847Z
DTSTART:20261128T150000Z
DTEND:20261128T170000Z
SUMMARY:Meet Me in St. Louis (1944)
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:The well-off Smith family has four beautiful daughters. Sevente
 en-year-old Esther has fallen in love with John\, who has just moved in ne
 xt door. He however\, barely notices her at first. The family is shocked w
 hen Mr. Smith reveals that he has been transferred to a nice position in N
 ew York\, which means that the family has to leave St. Louis and the 1903 
 St. Louis Fair.\nhttps://www.gardencinemas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass
 : https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7f9f78e6ac84266827704314ffa377559314873d@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261128T153847Z
DTSTART:20261128T151500Z
DTEND:20261128T171500Z
SUMMARY:Ebenezer
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:Times: 10:15am\, 12:45pm\nThis November\, prepare to be ghosted
 . Johnny Depp is the deliciously unpleasant Ebenezer Scrooge in a thrillin
 g reimagining of the most iconic ghost story of all time. On one unforgett
 able Christmas Eve\, Ebenezer collides with his past\, present\, and futur
 e on a supernatural journey that will decide his ultimate fate. If you thi
 nk you know his story\, think again.\nhttps://www.gardencinemas.net/\nFrom
  Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:05126a8d377a5e0cce27d9d363bef9171fa11071@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261128T153847Z
DTSTART:20261128T153000Z
DTEND:20261128T173000Z
SUMMARY:Disney's Hexed
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:Times: 10:30am\, 12:30pm\, 3:30pm\, 6pm\, 8:30pm\nIn Walt Disne
 y Animation Studios' all-new magical coming-of-age saga\, “Hexed\,” an
  impulsive and unconventional teenage girl named Billie discovers secret m
 agical abilities which\, once unleashed\, hurtle her into a spectacle-fill
 ed journey out of suburbia and into a vast witch realm called Hexe. Forced
  to team up with her cautious mother\, Alice\, they uncover family mysteri
 es that could change the world of witches forever.\nhttps://www.gardencine
 mas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3de90f292598103657aa0b42324b1aab47054643@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261128T153847Z
DTSTART:20261128T170000Z
DTEND:20261128T190000Z
SUMMARY:Focker In-Law
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12pm\, 2:20pm\, 4:40pm\, 7pm\, 9:30pm\nThis Thanksgiving
 \, the Circle of Trust expands as Ben Stiller\, Robert De Niro and Ariana 
 Grande star in a hilarious new chapter in the blockbuster Meet the Parents
  franchise. Still operating as a helicopter parent to his adult kids\, Gre
 g Focker’s anxieties spiral out of control when his son brings home a fo
 rmidable new girlfriend and reveals that he plans to propose.\nhttps://www
 .gardencinemas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/weste
 rnma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:109a5ef56a0925504f251e72a725579c281b0a4c@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261128T153847Z
DTSTART:20261128T170000Z
DTEND:20261128T190000Z
SUMMARY:The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12pm\, 3:15pm\, 6:15pm\, 9pm\nFrom acclaimed director Fr
 ancis Lawrence\, THE HUNGER GAMES: SUNRISE ON THE REAPING follows sixteen-
 year-old Haymitch Abernathy (Joseph Zada) from District 12\, beginning on 
 the morning of the reaping for the 50th Annual Hunger Games\, also known a
 s the Second Quarter Quell\, the biggest Games yet with twice as many trib
 utes.Set in the world of Panem 24 years before the events of The Hunger Ga
 mes\, the story follows Haymitch into the arena\, where he forms an unlike
 ly alliance with fellow tribute Maysilee Donner (Mckenna Grace) and joins 
 a coalition determined to challenge the Capitol’s control under Presiden
 t Snow (Ralph Fiennes). As the competition unfolds\, Haymitch risks everyt
 hing to take down the Games from within the arena — setting in motion th
 e rebellion that will change Panem forever.\nhttps://www.gardencinemas.net
 /\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e6a0635a0aa164df71c7314a478be8478b8ee459@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261128T153847Z
DTSTART:20261128T171500Z
DTEND:20261128T191500Z
SUMMARY:Paper Tiger
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:15pm\, 3:15pm\, 6:45pm\, 9:30pm\nIn James Gray’s de
 eply felt and intense drama\, two brothers become entangled in a scheme th
 at turns out to be too good to be true. As they try to navigate their way 
 through the dangerous world of the Russian mafia\, family bonds begin to f
 ray with life-altering consequences.\nhttps://www.gardencinemas.net/\nFrom
  Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c52ba45391a9c91bbcc27c92cf6a4be56f5af028@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261128T153847Z
DTSTART:20261128T174500Z
DTEND:20261128T194500Z
SUMMARY:I Play Rocky
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:45pm\, 3:30pm\, 6:15pm\, 9:15pm\nThe film is an elect
 rifying true story about an unknown actor with an unshakable belief that h
 e wasn’t just meant to write Rocky—he was meant to be Rocky Balboa. To
 ld “no” at every turn\, Sylvester Stallone bets everything on himself\
 , holding the line on playing the lead against seemingly impossible odds. 
 The result is the ultimate underdog story behind the ultimate underdog mov
 ie.\nhttps://www.gardencinemas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pu
 shpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
