DTSTART:20261128T180000Z
DTEND:20261128T200000Z
SUMMARY:Hershey
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1pm\, 3:45pm\, 6:30pm\, 9:15pm\nBased on the life of Mil
 ton Hershey\, founder of the iconic Hershey chocolate company. Milton's gr
 it and determination to conquer the world of candy-making propel him from 
 bankruptcy to monumental success\, and the love of his life\, Kitty\, help
 s him build a legacy sweeter than any candy bar. But when Kitty falls ill\
 , Milton’s wild optimism teeters on the edge of destruction\, and she sp
 arks an even bolder dream: to leave their fortune in the hands of America
 ’s children in need.\nhttps://www.gardencinemas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Weste
 rn Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
