SUMMARY:Wicker
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:An audacious comedic fable about sex\, marriage\, and the absur
 dities of social convention\, WICKER tells the wholly original love story 
 of an ostracized fisherwoman (Colman) who commissions a husband to be made
  by the local basketmaker (Dinklage). When her wicker husband (Skarsgård)
  proves more spectacular than she ever imagined\, his soulful spirit and u
 nique prowess awaken something inside her\, setting off a wave of jealousy
 \, fascination\, and upheaval that threatens the very fabric of village li
 fe.\nhttps://www.gardencinemas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pu
 shpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
