  expands as Ben Stiller\, Robert De Niro and Ariana Grande star in a hilar
 ious new chapter in the blockbuster Meet the Parents franchise. Still oper
 ating as a helicopter parent to his adult kids\, Greg Focker’s anxieties
  spiral out of control when his son brings home a formidable new girlfrien
