DTEND:20261201T223000Z
SUMMARY:Hershey
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:Times: 3:30pm\, 6:15pm\nBased on the life of Milton Hershey\, f
 ounder of the iconic Hershey chocolate company. Milton's grit and determin
 ation to conquer the world of candy-making propel him from bankruptcy to m
 onumental success\, and the love of his life\, Kitty\, helps him build a l
 egacy sweeter than any candy bar. But when Kitty falls ill\, Milton’s wi
 ld optimism teeters on the edge of destruction\, and she sparks an even bo
 lder dream: to leave their fortune in the hands of America’s children in
  need.\nhttps://www.gardencinemas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https:/
 /pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c682372fa822bb19aaa6e88b7ce1d53c63b62615@pushpin.city
