DTSTART:20261201T203000Z
DTEND:20261201T223000Z
SUMMARY:I Play Rocky
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:Times: 3:30pm\, 6:15pm\nThe film is an electrifying true story 
 about an unknown actor with an unshakable belief that he wasn’t just mea
 nt to write Rocky—he was meant to be Rocky Balboa. Told “no” at ever
 y turn\, Sylvester Stallone bets everything on himself\, holding the line 
 on playing the lead against seemingly impossible odds. The result is the u
 ltimate underdog story behind the ultimate underdog movie.\nhttps://www.ga
 rdencinemas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernm
 a/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
