DTEND:20261201T223000Z
SUMMARY:Paper Tiger
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:Times: 3:30pm\, 6:30pm\nIn James Gray’s deeply felt and inten
 se drama\, two brothers become entangled in a scheme that turns out to be 
 too good to be true. As they try to navigate their way through the dangero
 us world of the Russian mafia\, family bonds begin to fray with life-alter
 ing consequences.\nhttps://www.gardencinemas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Western Ma
 ss: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
